  "dct:description": "The DSLO v0.8 Invariant Layer defines the invariant families, continuity bands, stability envelopes, and legality constraints required for federated geometry. Invariant surfaces remain deterministic, invariant-preserving, non-runtime, and non-agentic. This layer inherits exclusively from DSLO v0.7 substrate and manifold lineage.",

